        "content": "<p>xia-chao opened <a href=\"https://github.com/bytecodealliance/wasmtime/pull/15047\">PR #15047</a> from <code>xia-chao:serve-cl-te</code> to <code>bytecodealliance:main</code>:</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>This rejects requests that carry both transfer-encoding and content-length before they are turned into a guest request, answering 400 the way the other malformed requests do.</p>\n<p>Hyper passes both headers through, and the guest was getting a content-length that did not match the body it read, which makes the framing ambiguous.<br>\n</p>\n</blockquote>",
